procedure processaRegistroNoBancoDeDados(SqlQuery:TSqlQuery;Fieldnames:TStringList;FieldTypes:THashedStringList;Nome:AnsiString;p:TpXmlNode;nLinha:integer);
var
  str1 : AnsiString;
  j : LongInt;
begin
  for j := 0 to Fieldnames.Count-1 do
  begin
    if assigned(p[j]) then
      str1 := p[j].AsString
    else
      if j < (FieldNames.Count-1) then // se não for o último campo
        raise Exception.Create('Número de campos no arquivo de entrada menor do que o esperado na linha '+inttostr(nlinha));
    SqlQuery.Params[j].clear;
    case strtoint(FieldTypes.Values[FieldNames[j]]) of
      fldZSTRING: begin
                    SqlQuery.Params[j].AsString := Str1;
                  end;
      34, {blob do oracle}
      fldBLOB:      begin
                      SqlQuery.Params[j].asBlob := BytesOf( str1);
                    end;
      fldINT16: if str1 <> '' then
                  SqlQuery.Params[j].AsSmallInt := strtoint(Str1)
                else
                begin
                  SqlQuery.Params[j].AsSmallInt := 0;
                  SqlQuery.Params[j].Clear;
                end;
      fldINT32: if str1 <> '' then
                  SqlQuery.Params[j].AsInteger := strtoint(Str1)
                else
                begin
                  SqlQuery.Params[j].AsInteger := 0;
                  SqlQuery.Params[j].Clear;
                end;
      fldFLOAT: if str1 <> '' then
                   SqlQuery.Params[j].AsFloat :=  p[j].AsFloat
                else
                begin
                  SqlQuery.Params[j].AsFloat := 0;
                  SqlQuery.Params[j].Clear;
                end;
      fldBCD,
      fldFMTBCD: if str1 <> '' then
                 begin
                   SqlQuery.Params[j].AsFloat :=  p[j].AsFloat
                 end
                 else
                 begin
                   SqlQuery.Params[j].AsFloat := 0;
                   SqlQuery.Params[j].Clear;
                 end;
      fldDATETIME: begin
                     try
                       SqlQuery.Params[j].{$IFDEF FPC}AsDateTime{$ELSE}AsSqlTimeStamp{$ENDIF} :=
                         DateTimeToSQLTimeStamp(StrToDateTime(Str1));
                     except
                       on EConvertError do // seta o campo como null
                       begin
                         SqlQuery.Params[j].{$IFDEF FPC}AsDateTime{$ELSE}AsSqlTimeStamp{$ENDIF} :=
                           DateTimeToSqlTimeStamp(0);
                         SqlQuery.Params[j].Clear;
                       end;
                     end;
                   end;
    end; // case
  end; // for
  SqlQuery.ExecSql;
end;

procedure PostIncluidb(JsonIn,JsonOut:TpXml);
var
  i : integer;
  NomeTabela: AnsiString;
  SqlConnection: TSqlConnection;
  TableFieldNames,
  FieldNames: TStringList;
  FieldTypes: THashedStringList;
  BaseSQL,
  Params: AnsiString;
  SqlQuery: TSqlQuery;
  TD: TTransactionDesc;
  nLinha:Integer;
{$IFDEF MSWINDOWS}
  JaTinhaTransacao : boolean;
{$ENDIF}
begin
  Params := '';
  if (pos('teste',PegaDirTab)) = 0 then
    raise Exception.Create('Esta API, por segurança só é permitida em ambiente de testes');

  TD.TransactionID := 1;
  TD.IsolationLevel := xilREADCOMMITTED;
  TableFieldNames := TStringList.Create;
  FieldTypes := THashedStringList.Create;
  FieldNames := TStringList.Create;
  SqlQuery := TSqlQuery.Create(nil);
  try
    NomeTabela := JsonIn['nomeTabela'].AsString;
    SqlConnection := GetSqlConnection(PegaDirTab);
    PegaTiposDosParametros(SqlConnection,FieldTypes,TableFieldNames, NomeTabela);

    // Verifica campos
    for i := 0 to JsonIn.documentElement.count-1 do
    begin
      if JsonIn[i].NodeName = 'campos' then
        FieldNames.add(JsonIn[i].AsString);
    end;

    for i := 0 to FieldNames.count-1 do
    begin
      if FieldTypes.Values[FieldNames[i]] = '' then
          raise Exception.Create('Campo '+FieldNames[i]+' não existe no na tabela '+NomeTabela);
    end;
    BaseSQL := 'insert into ' + nomeTabela;
    BaseSQL := BaseSQL + ' (';
    for i := 0 to Fieldnames.Count-1 do
    begin
      BaseSql := BaseSql + Fieldnames[i];
      Params := Params + ':p' + inttostr(i+1);
      if i < FieldNames.Count-1 then
      begin
        BaseSql := BaseSql + ', ';
        Params := Params + ', ';
      end;
    end;
    BaseSql := BaseSql + ') values (' + Params + ')';
    SQLQuery.Sql.Add(BaseSql);
    SQLQuery.SQLConnection := SqlConnection;
    {$IFNDEF FPC}
      SQLQuery.MaxBlobSize := -1;
    {$ENDIF}

    nLinha := 0;
{$IFDEF MSWINDOWS}
    JaTinhaTransacao := SqlConnection.InTransaction;
    if not JaTinhaTransacao then
      SqlConnection.StartTransaction(TD);
{$ELSE}
    SqlConnection.StartTransaction(TD);
{$ENDIF}
    try
      SetFieldsTypes(SqlQuery,FieldNames,FieldTypes);
      SQLQuery.Prepared := true;
      for i := 0 to JsonIn.documentElement.count-1 do
      begin
        if JsonIn[i].NodeName = 'dados' then
        begin
          processaRegistroNoBancoDeDados(SqlQuery,FieldNames,FieldTypes,NomeTabela,JsonIn[i],nLinha);
          inc(nLinha);
        end;
      end;
{$IFDEF MSWINDOWS}
      if not JaTinhaTransacao then
        SqlConnection.Commit(TD);
{$ELSE}
      SqlConnection.Commit(TD);
{$ENDIF}
    except
{$IFDEF MSWINDOWS}
      if not JaTinhaTransacao then
        SqlConnection.RollBack(TD);
{$ELSE}
      SqlConnection.RollBack(TD);
{$ENDIF}
      raise;
    end;
    JsonOut.add('quantidadeIncluidos').AsInteger := nLinha;
    JsonOut.add('success').AsBoolean := true;
  finally
    TableFieldNames.free;
    FieldTypes.free;
    FieldNames.free;
    SqlQuery.free;
  end;
end;

procedure GetLsdb(JsonIn,JsonOut:TpXml);
var
  FieldNames: TStringList;
  i: integer;
  NomeTabela: AnsiString;
  BaseSql: AnsiString;
  SqlQuery: TSqlQuery;
  linha,
  campo: TpXmlNode;
begin
  if (pos('teste',PegaDirTab)) = 0 then
    raise Exception.Create('Esta API, por segurança só é permitida em ambiente de testes');
  FieldNames := TStringList.Create;
  SqlQuery := TSqlQuery.Create(nil);
  try
    NomeTabela := JsonIn['nomeTabela'].AsString;

    for i := 0 to JsonIn.documentElement.count-1 do
    begin
      if JsonIn[i].NodeName = 'campos' then
        FieldNames.add(JsonIn[i].AsString);
    end;
    BaseSQL := 'select ';
    for i := 0 to Fieldnames.Count-1 do
    begin
      BaseSql := BaseSql + Fieldnames[i];
      if i < FieldNames.Count-1 then
        BaseSql := BaseSql + ', ';
    end;
    BaseSql := BaseSql + ' from '+NomeTabela;
    if assigned(JsonIn['condicao']) then
      BaseSql := BaseSql + ' where ' +  JsonIn['condicao'].AsString;
    SQLQuery.Sql.Add(BaseSql);
    SQLQuery.SQLConnection := GetSqlConnection(PegaDirTab);

    SqlQuery.open;
    while not SqlQuery.eof do
    begin
      linha := JsonOut.add('dados');
      linha.isArray := true;
      for i := 0 to SqlQuery.Fields.Count-1 do
      begin
        campo := linha.add('__Array');
        campo.isArray := true;
        campo.AsString := SqlQuery.Fields[i].AsString;
      end;
      SqlQuery.next;
    end;
    SqlQuery.close;
  finally
    FieldNames.free;
    SqlQuery.free;
  end;
end;

procedure PostExcluidb(JsonIn,JsonOut:TpXml);
var
  FieldNames: TStringList;
  i: integer;
  NomeTabela: AnsiString;
  BaseSql,
  whereSql: AnsiString;
  SqlQuery: TSqlQuery;
  ConexaoSql: TSqlConnection;
  ICampos,
  ListaIndices: THashedStringList;
  FieldTypes: THashedStringList;
  TableFieldNames: TStringList;
  TD: TTransactionDesc;
  AParam: AInteger;
{$IFDEF MSWINDOWS}
  JaTinhaTransacao : boolean;
{$ENDIF}
begin
{$IFDEF FPC} AParam := default(AInteger); {$ENDIF}
  TD.TransactionID := 1;
  TD.IsolationLevel := xilREADCOMMITTED;
  if (pos('teste',PegaDirTab)) = 0 then
    raise Exception.Create('Esta API, por segurança só é permitida em ambiente de testes');
  FieldNames := TStringList.Create;
  ICampos := THashedStringList.Create;
  ListaIndices := THashedStringList.Create();
  ConexaoSql := GetSqlConnection(pegaDirTab);
  TableFieldNames:= TStringList.Create;
  FieldTypes:= THashedStringList.Create;
  SqlQuery := TSqlQuery.Create(nil);
  try
    NomeTabela := JsonIn['nomeTabela'].AsString;

    for i := 0 to JsonIn.documentElement.count-1 do
    begin
      if JsonIn[i].NodeName = 'campos' then
        FieldNames.add(JsonIn[i].AsString);
    end;
    PegaIndicesDaTabela(ConexaoSql,ListaIndices,NomeTabela);
    PegaTiposDosParametros(ConexaoSQL, FieldTypes, TableFieldNames, nomeTabela);
    VerificaChave(ListaIndices,FieldNames,ICampos);
    WhereSql := '';
    SetLength(AParam,FieldNames.Count);
    for i := 0 to FieldNames.Count -1 do
    begin
      if length(WhereSql) > 0 then
        WhereSql := WhereSql + ' AND ';
      WhereSql := WhereSql + FieldNames[i] + '=:p' + inttostr(i+1);
    end;

    BaseSQL := 'delete from ' + nomeTabela + ' where '+ WhereSql;
    SQLQuery.Sql.Add(BaseSql);
    SQLQuery.SQLConnection := ConexaoSql;
{$IFDEF MSWINDOWS}
    JaTinhaTransacao := ConexaoSql.InTransaction;
    if not JaTinhaTransacao then
      ConexaoSql.StartTransaction(TD);
{$ELSE}
    ConexaoSql.StartTransaction(TD);
{$ENDIF}
    try
      SetFieldsTypes(SqlQuery,iCampos,FieldTypes);
      SQLQuery.Prepared := true;
      for i := 0 to JsonIn.documentElement.count-1 do
      begin
        if JsonIn[i].NodeName = 'dados' then
        begin
          processaRegistroNoBancoDeDados(SqlQuery,FieldNames,FieldTypes,NomeTabela,JsonIn[i],i);
        end;
      end;
{$IFDEF MSWINDOWS}
      if not JaTinhaTransacao then
        ConexaoSql.Commit(TD);
{$ELSE}
      ConexaoSql.Commit(TD);
{$ENDIF}
    except
{$IFDEF MSWINDOWS}
      if not JaTinhaTransacao then
        ConexaoSql.RollBack(TD);
{$ELSE}
      ConexaoSql.RollBack(TD);
{$ENDIF}
      raise;
    end;
    JsonOut.add('success').AsBoolean := true;
  finally
    FieldNames.free;
    ICampos.free;
    ListaIndices.free;
    SqlQuery.free;
    FieldTypes.free;
  end;
end;

